WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Choose the service location and start visitor check-in.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Choose a walk-in visit. The app guides each step.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Enter fictional contact details and select Passport service.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Readiness questions flag a missing photo before the counter.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The check-in succeeds in an isolated local database.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Staff see the missing-item flag and record a review note.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
A staff member completes the visit and updates its status.

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Operational reporting reflects the fictional demonstration visit.
